# SVN revision diff
# Source: https://svn.code.sf.net/p/civ4betterai/code/
# Revision: 287
# Author: blakeciv
# Date: 2007-01-23T21:26:12.353705Z
# Coverage: full
# Message:
#   Added AI_PEACE strategy infrastructure (does nothing yet but should show up if the AI thinks it's in a peaceful situation)
#   Tweaked some other stuff in strategies (I have a little more tweaking to do too).
#   Made a couple governor tweaks (unhealth and such)
#   Reworked the Unit AI types for consistency - AI types are now basically either defensive or offensive and defensive types should not group with offensive types, defensive types should not group up much if it all - instead preferring to remain free so they can be shuffled to wherever the defense code tells them to go.
#   
#   Tweaked the floating defender stuff in a number of ways (mostly reduced), also adding extra defenders if Raging Barbarians is on.
#   AI_isDefended should not be used much in chooseProduction now - only in extreme cases. Otherwise floating defenders should handle it.
# Changed paths (5):
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/AI_Defines.h
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvCityAI.cpp
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvGameTextMgr.cpp
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvPlayerAI.cpp
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvUnitAI.cpp

